    <briefdescription>
<para>Common base struct for callable-wrapping operators. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This base struct provides common functionality for operators that wrap callable invocations, particularly for exception-checking operations. Derived structs (such as <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1throws__" kindref="compound">throws_</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="structmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1nothrow__" kindref="compound">nothrow_</ref></computeroutput>) use this base to store and manage the pre-computed boolean result of a callable invocation, enabling consistent reporting and composition of exception-checking assertions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
